      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "data/img/9a-25ee58.jpg",
          "alt": "A Year with Krishnamurti",
          "source": "https://kfoundation.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/9a.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "In Ending is a New Beginning"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The year-long journey of daily Krishnamurti texts has now come to an end, but you can continue exploring in a number of ways. Thousands of video and audio recordings are available on our YouTube channels, including extracts and previously unpublished talks and discussions. The Foundation website includes carefully chosen quotes, book suggestions and an extensive Index of Topics. The site also features a search function that enables easy access to transcripts and videos of Krishnamurti’s talks, as well as curated materials."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "And the inquiry need not end here.",
          "style": "lead"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You are warmly invited to visit The Krishnamurti Centre at Brockwood Park, founded by Krishnamurti, where you can meet others who are deeply interested in exploring these questions together. We look forward to seeing you soon.",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "The Krishnamurti Centre",
              "url": "https://krishnamurticentre.org.uk/"
            },
            {
              "text": "Brockwood Park",
              "url": "https://kfoundation.org/brockwood/"
            }
          ]
